                <p>
                    Understand the purpose of the system and the problems
                    it aims to address.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="overview-card">
                <p>
                    Public places can face problems such as damaged roads,
                    overflowing garbage, broken streetlights, and other
                    civic issues. Reporting these problems and finding out
                    what happened afterward can sometimes be difficult.
                </p>

                <p>
                    The CivicTrace provides a common online
                    platform where citizens can submit complaints and check
                    their progress. Complaints can include a description,
                    location details, and an image as evidence. Authorized
                    officials can review complaints, assign departments,
                    set priorities, and update their status.
                </p>

